# Atlas Core Streamlined Onboarding Flow Specification
**Author:** Rune Adeyemi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 12:15  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Optimized user onboarding flow for Atlas Core aimed at cutting infrastructure and third-party validation costs while reducing drop-off rates, referencing guidelines from Company Document.

